# Plans Require Tracked Issues

Execution plans must map to issues with:
- explicit scope and out-of-scope
- testable acceptance criteria
- validation harness commands
- dependencies and milestone context
- QA package

Plan steps must not be treated as complete if issue contract is incomplete.
